			text = [=[VanCleef is the wound that {link:stormwind-city}Stormwind{/link} gave itself. He was a builder, not a bandit, and those who knew him remember a talented and industrious man. His Brotherhood was born of a real injustice. Yet his revenge has fallen hardest on the common people of {link:westfall}Westfall{/link}, not on the nobles who cheated him, and it has driven the kingdom's own breadbasket to ruin.]=],
