• He gathered the exiled masons in {link:westfall}Westfall{/link} and founded the {link:defias-brotherhood}Defias Brotherhood{/link}.
• He took the {link:the-deadmines}Deadmines{/link} for his stronghold and hired goblins to build a warship in its depths.
